WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I can stand it. The night is long and I can sleep.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,400
Isn’t this time for rest?

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,600
Not without

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,400
How long will it take for your Dapeng to ride?

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,600
I don’t know. Ten days and a half month should be fine.

6
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,600
Otherwise this is the case

7
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,600
After riding the Dapeng, you come to my place for personal training.

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,400
How much does it cost to take the Dapeng ride? Four hundred per day. Four hundred.

9
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,400
Do you know how much it costs for an hour of private tutoring here?

10
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,600
At least three hundred yuan an hour

11
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,800
Your asking price can be higher

12
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,400
Otherwise, I'll help you test out private lessons here first.

13
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,200
See if these members are willing

14
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,900
For our private lessons, you can choose a specific time

15
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,200
You bring one lesson a day

16
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,600
I will arrange a small class for you with four or five people in one class.

17
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,600
Is this possible?

18
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,200
So how much can I earn in one class?

19
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,800
I think with your ability, fourteen hundred yuan per class is fine.

20
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,600
If you bring five people, it will cost you two thousand yuan.

21
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,100
Our side is divided half and half

22
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,700
In other words, we take one thousand from the store

23
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:41,800
Take a thousand for yourself

24
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,000
Would you be willing to make a thousand dollars an hour?

25
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,600
Earn a thousand an hour

26
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,600
Oh my God, it’s so profitable

27
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,900
OK I do

28
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,600
Then I'll take some videos and photos for you

29
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,000
Come on, let's go outside

30
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,780
Show everyone your power

31
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:56,780
You pull this and I'll take a video for you
